#### Elliptic Integral of the Third Kind

\[\Pi(n;\varphi\,\omega)=\int_{0}^{\sigma}\,(1-n\sin^{2}\theta)^{-1}\,[1-\sin^{2} \alpha\,\sin^{2}\theta]^{-1/2}d\theta\]

If \(x\)=sn (\(u|m\)),

